Attribution: Leah Childers

The audio (audio/*.mp3) was rendered with the Salamander Grand Piano V3 sample set by Alexander Holm, licensed
under CC BY 3.0 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/), in the SF2 conversion made for the FreePats
project, version V3+20200602
(https://freepats.zenvoid.org/Piano/SalamanderGrandPiano/SalamanderGrandPiano-SF2-V3+20200602.tar.xz). That attribution
applies to the audio and must be kept with it.

The music:
- p13-*: entirely written by the Neurallegro model (the prompt was a key signature, a time signature, a tempo and
  clefs, with no notes).
- p03-*: the first two bars (the pickup and the first full bar) are from "Adeste Fideles" ("O Come All Ye
  Faithful"), arranged by Samuel Webbe (public domain); everything after
  bar 2 was written by the model.
- p04-*: the first four bars are a short march opening written for testing this project; everything after bar 4
  was written by the model (in p04-step300 the model also added one note to the last chord of bar 4).
